id: pm-beads-51fi
title: Make reconciliation updates conditional on inspected item versions
description: "The workspace transaction lease serializes cooperating transactions, while ordinary PmClient and CLI item mutations use a different write boundary. An ordinary update between a reconciliation step inspection and mutation can be overwritten. This review round corrects the guarantee and requires pausing ordinary writers; implementing an atomic expected-version mutation needs a separate SDK capability/design."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T20:34:44.084Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T20:36:13.179Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Use a supported atomic expected-version check or shared writer boundary; reproduce an ordinary write between inspect and update and prove it survives with a typed stale refusal; retain non-git operation and compensation safety.
parent: pm-beads-i59r
